{"title":"GitHub Copilot Dev Days Toronto","startsAt":"2026-10-21T18:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-21T20:30:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"**REGISTER AT [https://luma.com/5mthp0p6](https://luma.com/5mthp0p6)** instead of Meetup for this event\\*\\*.\\*\\* This event takes place at Microsoft Headquarters building which requires attendees to register using provided link to get QR code to a unique QR Code in order to enter the Microsoft Headquarters.\n\nPlanning is underway. RSVP now to reserve your spot. Space is limited.\n\nDev Days is a global, in-person, community-led experience bringing developers, DevOps enthusiasts, and local tech communities together to discover what’s possible with GitHub Copilot.\nThis isn’t your typical conference talk series. It’s a hands-on opportunity to explore real-world workflows, practical use cases, and the latest ways to put GitHub Copilot to work.\n\nJoin us for interactive demos, hands-on activities, and workshops focused on GitHub Copilot — and leave with practical skills, ideas, and techniques you can start using right away.\n\nCome curious. Get hands-on. Build something. See what GitHub Copilot can really do.\n\nEvent is co-hosted with Microsoft and North Toronto Cloud & DevOps User Group.","venue":{"name":"Microsoft Canada HQ Downtown","address":"4400-81 Bay Street, Toronto","lat":43.64403,"lng":-79.37754,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Toronto Enterprise DevOps User Group","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/e/0/a/f/highres_536037519.jpeg"}